> @x4m dumb question, but am I expected to create database for console on my own and odyssey will install required tables on its own?

Just add to config
```
storage "local" {
	type "local"
}

database "console" {
	user default {
		authentication "none"
		pool "session"
		storage "local"
	}
}
```

And you will be able to connect to DB ```console```
